{"seq":2,"slug":"associated-types","title":"关联类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/type-system/associated-types","wordCount":894,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"关联类型\">关联类型</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>关联类型（Associated Types）是 Swift 协议中的&quot;类型占位符&quot;，它允许协议在不指定具体类型的情况下声明类型关系。遵循协议的类型在实现时确定关联类型的具体绑定。关联类型是 Swift 泛型系统的重要组成部分，也是理解类型擦除（Type Erasure）和 Swift 5.7 引入的主关联类型（Primary Associated Types）的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    AT[&quot;关联类型 Associated Type&quot;] --&gt; PD[&quot;协议声明中的占位符&quot;]&#10;    AT --&gt; TB[&quot;类型绑定&quot;]&#10;    AT --&gt; TE[&quot;类型擦除&quot;]&#10;    AT --&gt; PAT[&quot;主关联类型 Swift 5.7&quot;]&#10;    TB --&gt; EX[&quot;显式 typealias&quot;]&#10;    TB --&gt; IM[&quot;编译器推断&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    AT[\"关联类型 Associated Type\"] --&gt; PD[\"协议声明中的占位符\"]\n    AT --&gt; TB[\"类型绑定\"]\n    AT --&gt; TE[\"类型擦除\"]\n    AT --&gt; PAT[\"主关联类型 Swift 5.7\"]\n    TB --&gt; EX[\"显式 typealias\"]\n    TB --&gt; IM[\"编译器推断\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>关联类型（<code>associatedtype</code>）是协议内部的<strong>类型占位符</strong>：协议只声明「存在某个类型」，而不指定它是谁，遵循协议的类型在实现时才能确定具体绑定。正是这种「延迟绑定」让协议在保持抽象的同时又能表达类型之间的关系。围绕它有几个关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>类型绑定</strong>——遵循类型可显式 <code>typealias</code> 指定，也可由编译器根据方法签名自动推断；</li>\n<li><strong>关联类型约束</strong>——用 <code>associatedtype Item: Comparable</code> 或 <code>where</code> 子句限制绑定的选择；</li>\n<li><strong>类型擦除</strong>——带关联类型的协议不能直接作类型使用，需用包装器或 <code>any</code>/<code>some</code> 解决；</li>\n<li><strong>主关联类型</strong>——Swift 5.7 起协议可用尖括号参数化（如 <code>Collection&lt;Int&gt;</code>），简化使用语法；</li>\n<li><strong>递归约束</strong>——<code>associatedtype Child: TreeNode where Child.Value == Value</code> 支持树、图等递归建模。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"基本用法\">基本用法</h2><p>使用 <code>associatedtype</code> 关键字在协议中声明关联类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol Container {&#10;    associatedtype Item&#10;    var count: Int { get }&#10;    mutating func append(_ item: Item)&#10;    subscript(i: Int) -&gt; Item { get }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    associatedtype</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Item</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    mutating</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item: Item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    subscript</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Item { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>遵循协议时，可以显式指定或让编译器推断关联类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct IntStack: Container {&#10;    typealias Item = Int&#10;&#10;    private var storage: [Int] = []&#10;    var count: Int { storage.count }&#10;&#10;    mutating func append(_ item: Int) {&#10;        storage.append(item)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    subscript(i: Int) -&gt; Int {&#10;        storage[i]&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct GenericStack&lt;Element&gt;: Container {&#10;    private var storage: [Element] = []&#10;    var count: Int { storage.count }&#10;&#10;    mutating func append(_ item: Element) {&#10;        storage.append(item)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    subscript(i: Int) -&gt; Element {&#10;        storage[i]&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IntStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Container </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    typealias</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> storage: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { storage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    mutating</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        storage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    subscript</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        storage[i]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GenericStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Container </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> storage: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { storage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    mutating</span><span style=\"color:#